  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Nuclear Energy Workshop Series, through The Webster Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting a series of four (4) Civil Nuclear Energy Workshops. The workshops will support industry and governments in developing strategies for deploying advanced reactor technologies, effectively addressing the risks and challenges associated with nascent nuclear technologies and assisting U.S. companies to engage with opportunities in USTDA-eligible countries in Europe and Eurasia. USTDA funding is supporting a series of three (3) Civil Nuclear Energy Workshops. The workshops will support industry and governments in developing strategies for deploying advanced reactor technologies, effectively addressing the risks and challenges associated with nascent nuclear technologies and assisting U.S. companies to engage with opportunities in USTDA-eligible countries in Europe and Eurasia.</narrative>
  </description>
